---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About Kirsty Thompson — Brand Strategist — Punk Lotus"
  description="Kirsty Thompson — senior brand and communications strategist. A decade-plus across agencies, startups and founders in Australia and internationally. Working remotely, Australia-wide."
>
  <Hero title="Senior brand strategy. Straight up." />

  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="stick reveal">
        <p class="lede">Most marketing gives me the ick.</p>
        <p class="hand aside">The jargon, the upsells — its role as the lackey of late-stage capitalism…</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>But then again, some people just make great shit and need to let the world know.</p>
        <p>I try and work with them.</p>
        <p>I'm <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kirstythompsononline/" rel="noopener">Kirsty Thompson</a>, a brand and communications strategist who also does the work. With over a decade working across agencies, startups and everything between, I’ve learnt the rules well enough to know which we can ditch.</p>
        <p><span class="hl">Best practice doesn't have to be boring.</span> You can be honest and still succeed. You can show up as yourself and be taken seriously. Some of marketing is complicated, but most of it is not.</p>
        <p>The message needs to land with the right people, in the right places. I figure out what that looks like, <span class="hl">tell you straight</span>, and get it done in a way that works for you. No upselling, no padded timelines.</p>
        <p>I'm here for when you're stuck. For when you just want it done. For when you're too close and it’s too personal. Or for when you want a collaborator.</p>
        <p>I've always been the translator — between you and your designer, your developer, the rest of the marketing machine, and now AI. I make sure it <span class="hl">keeps your identity</span>, instead of turning you into everyone else.</p>
        <p>This is about your voice, your vision, your abilities and resources — all shaped into something that works in the real world.</p>
        <p>I bring the branding knowledge, the audience insight, the commercial nous, the strategic thinking.</p>
        <p>You bring your craft, conviction, and the thing you make.</p>
        <p class="lede">No fluff. No bullshit.</p>
        <div class="links"><a class="more" href="/brandconsulting">See the work →</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--orange" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap split reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Ready?<br />Get in touch.</h2>
        <p><a href="mailto:kt@punklotus.com">kt@punklotus.com</a></p>
      </div>
      <ContactForm name="contact-about" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .stick .lede { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); margin-bottom: .4em; }
  .aside { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.7rem); color: var(--orange-deep); }
</style>
